git clone https://github.com/YusufShamsu/Submodules.git
Once any changes identified , pull the submodule repo and then stage the changes from the main repo .


git checkout main 

git pull

git submodule update --remote

git submodule update --remote --merge

git submodule update --init --recursive


git config submodule.recurse true


submodulle changes into main repo 

main repo branch switching on submodule commits 


